{"id":"n67511-2-7","stage":4,"title":"연대 · 联合","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67511-2-7-1","ko":"민수야, 수학여행에 다녀오니까 어떠니?","zh":"敏洙，参加完修学旅行感觉怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민수야,","meaning":"敏洙","explanation":"민수：敏洙；야：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"민수야","audio":"/audio/49cde90a85162303bb13.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"수학여행에","meaning":"(学校组织的)参观活动，学习旅行","explanation":"수학여행：(学校组织的)参观活动，学习旅行；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"수학여행","audio":"/audio/8aecbf0cd13e3bf8336e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64721","senseId":"1","lemma":"수학여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다녀오니까","meaning":"去一趟，去一下","explanation":"다녀오다：去一趟，去一下；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"다녀오다","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64529","senseId":"2","lemma":"다녀오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떠니?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8aecbf0cd13e3bf8","term":"수학여행","zh":"(学校组织的)参观活动，学习旅行","audio":"/audio/8aecbf0cd13e3bf8336e.mp3","entryId":"64721","definition":"教学活动之一，为拓宽知识，学生在教师的指导下通过实地观察而进行的旅行。","pronunciation":["수항녀행"]},{"id":"09b8a3cf21a41c7a","term":"다녀오다","zh":"去一趟，去一下","audio":"/audio/09b8a3cf21a41c7a72ed.mp3","entryId":"64529","definition":"为做某事而去某地后又回来。","pronunciation":["다녀오다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/c052d31475f97c9593ce.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67511-2-7-2","ko":"친구들하고 좀 더 연대가 생긴 것 같아요.","zh":"和朋友们好像更团结、更有联系了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"친구들하고","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；하고：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"更，更加","explanation":"더：更，更加","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"2","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"연대가","meaning":"联合，共同","explanation":"연대：联合，共同；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"연대","audio":"/audio/8af227e2d7c8f40fd7ac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67511","senseId":"2","lemma":"연대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생긴","meaning":"发生，产生","explanation":"생기다：发生，产生；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"3","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아요.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"更，更加","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"与比较对象或某个标准相比，程度加深；在那之上。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"8af227e2d7c8f40f","term":"연대","zh":"联合，共同","audio":"/audio/8af227e2d7c8f40fd7ac.mp3","entryId":"67511","definition":"以相同的目标或用意相互被密切地连接。","pronunciation":["연대"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"发生，产生","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"出现事故或事情、问题等。","pronunciation":["생기다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c0413d993292596e6930.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.9,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67511","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":139,"sequenceScore":2.7267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["和朋友们好像更团结、更有联系了。","敏洙，参加完修学旅行感觉怎么样？","我们的店在住宅区，您可能会很难找到的。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["敏洙，参加完修学旅行感觉怎么样？","我们的店在住宅区，您可能会很难找到的。","和朋友们好像更团结、更有联系了。"],"answer":2}]}
